{
    "info": {
        "name": "BG6 - Exports / Downloads + AP Supplier Detail",
        "description": "BG6 collection. Validates the unified Exports facade and the closing AP supplier detail route:\n\n- `GET  /api/accounting/ap/suppliers/:id` — closes the BG0 missing-route gap. Returns supplier + summary block + recentBills + recentPayments. Permission: `accounting:ap:bill:read`.\n- `POST /api/exports`              — request a new export (sourceDomain=reports, reportRunId, format=CSV). **C-01: `format=PDF` now returns 501** — Nimbus has no PDF renderer and the previous PDF path wrote a plain-text file stamped `application/pdf`. Wrapped by BG3 facade (category:null, idempotencyMode:optional). Permission: `exports:write`.\n- `GET  /api/exports`              — paginated history list across both `reports` and `documents` source domains. Permission: `exports:read`.\n- `GET  /api/exports/:id`          — detail returning the unified envelope. Permission: `exports:read`.\n- `GET  /api/exports/:id/download` — streams the artefact bytes. Permission: `exports:download`.\n\nUnified envelope: `{ exportId, sourceDomain, sourceType, sourceRefId, requestedBy, requestedAt, status, format, fileName, contentType, fileSizeBytes, checksum, readyAt, failedAt, failureReason, downloadReady, downloadUrl, retentionExpiresAt }`. `exportId = '<sourceDomain>:<id>'`. Status mapping: PENDING→QUEUED, READY→COMPLETED, FAILED→FAILED.\n\nLocked rules verified:\n- `/api/auth/me` canonical (R14).\n- POST /api/auth/login accepts [200, 201] (R12).\n- New permissions: `exports:read | exports:write | exports:download` granted to Owner / Manager / Accountant. **Chef intentionally denied** — verified 403.\n- BG3 facade reused for the one mutating route (`POST /api/exports`).\n- No new schema (delegates to existing ExportArtifact + Document tables).\n- Public diner payments still PENDING (out of scope).\n- PesaPal owner-SaaS-only (out of scope).\n- No hotel structures.\n- Async vs sync semantics preserved honestly: report exports complete synchronously today; envelope still expresses status + downloadReady so a future async pipeline does not break the contract.\n\n⚠️ **Re-import required after any script change.** Postman caches scripts at import time.",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "variable": [
        { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3001" },
        { "key": "ownerEmail", "value": "owner@demo.local" },
        { "key": "ownerPassword", "value": "Owner#123" },
        { "key": "chefEmail", "value": "chef@demo.local" },
        { "key": "chefPassword", "value": "Chef#123" },
        { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
        { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "" },
        { "key": "chefToken", "value": "" },
        { "key": "orgId", "value": "" },
        { "key": "branchId", "value": "" },
        { "key": "bg6Suffix", "value": "" },
        { "key": "bg6IdemKey", "value": "" },
        { "key": "bg6SupplierId", "value": "" },
        { "key": "bg6ReportRunId", "value": "" },
        { "key": "bg6ExportId", "value": "" },
        { "key": "bg6ExportIdReplay", "value": "" }
    ],
    "event": [
        {
            "listen": "prerequest",
            "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                    "// BG6 canonical pre-request (R3/R4/R5/R12/R14/R16). Mirrors BG5.",
                    "const baseUrl = pm.collectionVariables.get('baseUrl') || 'http://localhost:3001';",
                    "const ownerEmail = pm.collectionVariables.get('ownerEmail') || 'owner@demo.local';",
                    "const ownerPassword = pm.collectionVariables.get('ownerPassword') || 'Owner#123';",
                    "const url = pm.request && pm.request.url ? pm.request.url.toString() : '';",
                    "const isPublicAuth = /\\/api\\/auth\\/(login|forgot-password|reset-password|invitations\\/accept|quick-pin-login)/.test(url);",
                    "const isHealth = /\\/api\\/health(\\?|$)/.test(url);",
                    "const isPublic = isPublicAuth || isHealth;",
                    "function getVar(k) {",
                    "  if (pm.environment && pm.environment.name) {",
                    "    const ev = pm.environment.get(k);",
                    "    if (ev !== undefined && ev !== null && ev !== '') return ev;",
                    "  }",
                    "  return pm.collectionVariables.get(k);",
                    "}",
                    "function setVar(k, v) {",
                    "  if (v === undefined || v === null || v === '') return;",
                    "  pm.collectionVariables.set(k, v);",
                    "  if (pm.environment && pm.environment.name) pm.environment.set(k, v);",
                    "}",
                    "function isJwtFresh(tok) {",
                    "  try {",
                    "    if (!tok || typeof tok !== 'string') return false;",
                    "    const parts = tok.split('.'); if (parts.length < 2) return false;",
                    "    const b = parts[1].replace(/-/g, '+').replace(/_/g, '/');",
                    "    const pad = b + '==='.slice((b.length + 3) % 4);",
                    "    const payload = JSON.parse((typeof Buffer !== 'undefined' ? Buffer.from(pad, 'base64').toString('utf8') : atob(pad)));",
                    "    return payload && payload.exp && (payload.exp * 1000 - Date.now()) > 60000;",
                    "  } catch (e) { return false; }",
                    "}",
                    "function ensureSuffix() {",
                    "  if (!getVar('bg6Suffix')) {",
                    "    const s = String(Date.now()) + '-' + Math.floor(Math.random()*1e4);",
                    "    setVar('bg6Suffix', s);",
                    "    setVar('bg6IdemKey', 'bg6-export-' + s);",
                    "  }",
                    "}",
                    "function ensureToken() {",
                    "  return new Promise((resolve) => {",
                    "    const tok = getVar('accessToken');",
                    "    if (isPublic || (tok && tok.length >= 20 && isJwtFresh(tok))) return resolve();",
                    "    pm.sendRequest({",
                    "      url: baseUrl + '/api/auth/login',",
                    "      method: 'POST',",
                    "      header: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },",
                    "      body: { mode: 'raw', raw: JSON.stringify({ email: ownerEmail, password: ownerPassword }) }",
                    "    }, (err, res) => {",
                    "      if (!err && res) {",
                    "        try {",
                    "          const j = res.json();",
                    "          if (j.accessToken) setVar('accessToken', j.accessToken);",
                    "          if (j.refreshToken) setVar('refreshToken', j.refreshToken);",
                    "        } catch (e) { /* ignore */ }",
                    "      }",
                    "      resolve();",
                    "    });",
                    "  });",
                    "}",
                    "function ensureMeContext() {",
                    "  return new Promise((resolve) => {",
                    "    if (isPublic) return resolve();",
                    "    if (getVar('branchId') && getVar('orgId')) return resolve();",
                    "    const tok = getVar('accessToken');",
                    "    if (!tok) return resolve();",
                    "    pm.sendRequest({",
                    "      url: baseUrl + '/api/auth/me',",
                    "      method: 'GET',",
                    "      header: { 'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + tok }",
                    "    }, (err, res) => {",
                    "      if (!err && res) {",
                    "        try {",
                    "          const j = res.json();",
                    "          if (j.context) {",
                    "            if (j.context.defaultOrganizationId) setVar('orgId', j.context.defaultOrganizationId);",
                    "            if (j.context.defaultBranchId) setVar('branchId', j.context.defaultBranchId);",
                    "          }",
                    "          if (Array.isArray(j.memberships) && j.memberships.length) {",
                    "            if (!getVar('orgId')) setVar('orgId', j.memberships[0].organizationId);",
                    "            if (!getVar('branchId')) setVar('branchId', j.memberships[0].branchId);",
                    "          }",
                    "        } catch (e) { /* ignore */ }",
                    "      }",
                    "      resolve();",
                    "    });",
                    "  });",
                    "}",
                    "function ensureChefToken() {",
                    "  return new Promise((resolve) => {",
                    "    if (isPublic) return resolve();",
                    "    const tok = getVar('chefToken');",
                    "    if (tok && tok.length >= 20 && isJwtFresh(tok)) return resolve();",
                    "    const e = getVar('chefEmail') || 'chef@demo.local';",
                    "    const p = getVar('chefPassword') || 'Chef#123';",
                    "    pm.sendRequest({",
                    "      url: baseUrl + '/api/auth/login',",
                    "      method: 'POST',",
                    "      header: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },",
                    "      body: { mode: 'raw', raw: JSON.stringify({ email: e, password: p }) }",
                    "    }, (err, res) => {",
                    "      if (!err && res) {",
                    "        try { const j = res.json(); if (j.accessToken) setVar('chefToken', j.accessToken); } catch (e) { /* ignore */ }",
                    "      }",
                    "      resolve();",
                    "    });",
                    "  });",
                    "}",
                    "ensureSuffix();",
                    "return ensureToken().then(ensureMeContext).then(ensureChefToken).catch((e) => console.log('[bg6 prereq] chain error', e && e.message));"
                ]
            }
        }
    ],
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "00 Read Me",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "README - variables, run order, locked rules",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health",
                            "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                            "path": ["api", "health"]
                        },
                        "description": "⚠️ **Re-import required after any script change.**\n\n## Run order\n1. **A. Auth & Context Baseline** — login owner + canonical /api/auth/me + login chef.\n2. **B. AP Supplier Detail** — create supplier fixture + GET detail + 404 + 403.\n3. **C. Create Export** — generate report run + POST /api/exports + validation 400s.\n4. **D. Export List / Detail** — GET list + filter + GET detail + malformed/unknown.\n5. **E. Download** — GET /api/exports/:id/download (stream).\n6. **F. Edge Cases / Conflicts** — unsupported sourceDomain, malformed exportId.\n7. **G. Permission Denial** — chef → 403 on every facade route + AP detail.\n8. **H. Reliability / Idempotency** — Idempotency-Key replay returns identical exportId.\n\n## Auto-populated variables\n- `accessToken`, `chefToken`, `orgId`, `branchId` (login + /api/auth/me).\n- `bg6Suffix`, `bg6IdemKey` (per-run).\n- `bg6SupplierId`, `bg6ReportRunId`, `bg6ExportId`, `bg6ExportIdReplay` (fixture writes).\n\n## Locked rules verified\n- `/api/auth/me` canonical (R14).\n- BG3 facade reused for POST /api/exports (`category: null`, `idempotencyMode: 'optional'`).\n- Permissions `exports:{read,write,download}` granted to Owner/Manager/Accountant; chef denied.\n- No new schema — delegates to existing ExportArtifact + Document tables.\n- Public diner payments still PENDING (untouched).\n- PesaPal owner-SaaS-only (untouched).\n- No hotel structures.\n- Async vs sync semantics preserved honestly via status + downloadReady envelope fields."
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "A. Auth & Context Baseline",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "Login Owner",
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
